cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Replay
message: If you use Replay in research or writing, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Daniel
    family-names: Saito
    affiliation: Red Robot K.K.
    website: "https://redrobot.jp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RedRobotKK/Replay"
url: "https://redrobot.jp"
abstract: >-
  A local tool that reproduces an LLM provider's prompt caching turn by turn,
  shows which turn broke the cache and what it cost, and scores alternative
  context layouts against what actually ran. Runs entirely on the user's machine.
keywords:
  - llm
  - prompt-caching
  - ai-agents
  - observability
  - developer-tools
license: Apache-2.0
